{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13444","headline":"成都爲客作 · 田澄","name":"成都爲客作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀郡将之远，城南万里桥。\n衣缘乡泪湿，貌以客愁销。\n地富鱼爲米，山芳桂是樵。\n旅游唯得酒，今日过明朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"田澄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}